            <ArticleTitle>Comprehensive approach to patellar pathology.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>493-501</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>As investigators continue to report new realignment operations, controversy persists regarding the selection of procedures for patients with intractable patellar pain. This report summarizes an approach to the patella involving well-documented operations used in individualized combinations tailored to each patient. The outline of the decision-making process is reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
